load @term/seed/code/structure/manifold
  find manifold

# An embedding: an inclusion of one space inside another that faithfully preserves its structure, so the smaller space
# is a genuine subspace of the larger, not merely mapped into it. A horosphere embeds the flat plane in hyperbolic
# space; the 24-cell embeds in four-dimensional space. The form carries the manifold being embedded.
form embedding
  link manifold, like manifold
